+  - `go mod tidy`
+  - `go test ./...`
+  - `go test -race ./...`
+  - `go vet ./...`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/...`
+  - `go test -race ./internal/controlplane/...`
+  - `go test -run TestMigrations ./...`
+  - `go test -run TestUsageReconciler ./internal/controlplane/metering`
